# Screenshots and logs. Every one of these is regenerable evidence
# about the board being looked at now, and this tree is inside
# OneDrive, so anything rewritten every few seconds is queued for
# upload again - point SUDOKU_DEBUG_DIR at scratch for a long run.
*.png
*.log
*.xml

# The digit templates, cut from the number pad on first run. Font
# constants, not configuration: deleting this costs one fresh puzzle to
# re-learn from.
templates.npz
__pycache__/
